@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Return & Cancellation Policy";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
            <nav aria-label="breadcrumb" class="mb-4">
                <ol class="breadcrumb">
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">Home</a></li>
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Return & Refund Policy</li>
                </ol>
            </nav>

            <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
                    <div class="bg-warning bg-opacity-10 text-warning p-3 rounded-circle me-3">
                        <i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat fs-2 text-warning"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-1">Return, Cancellation & Refund Policy</h2>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Clear and transparent policies for patients</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <hr class="my-4 text-muted" />

                <div class="content text-secondary lh-lg">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-x-circle text-danger me-2"></i>1. Appointment Cancellation</h5>
                    <p>Patients may cancel or reschedule their appointment at least <strong>4 hours</strong> prior to the designated appointment time without any penalty fee.</p>

                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4"><i class="bi bi-cash-stack text-success me-2"></i>2. Consultation Fee Refund</h5>
                    <p>If you have paid the consultation fee online (via bKash/Nagad/Card) and the doctor cancels the session or is unavailable due to an emergency, <strong>100% of your paid amount</strong> will be refunded to your source payment method within 24 to 48 hours.</p>

                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle text-warning me-2"></i>3. No-Show Policy</h5>
                    <p>Failure to attend the confirmed appointment without prior cancellation will not be eligible for a refund, as the doctor's time slot was reserved exclusively for you.</p>

                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4"><i class="bi bi-headset text-primary me-2"></i>4. Dispute Resolution</h5>
                    <p>For any refund queries or payment discrepancies, contact our helpline at <strong>+880 1708588330</strong> with your Appointment ID and Transaction ID.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
